hadiths[12]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1239","[AI-translation] Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tu apna, shikaari, kutta chhoray, to Allah ka naam le, kar chhor. Phir agar wo tere shikaar ko rok le aur tu us ko zinda paye, to us ko zabah kar aur agar maar daalay aur khaye nahi, to tu us ko kha le aur agar tere kuttay ke saath doosra kutta milay aur janwar maara ja chuka ho, to us ko mat kha kyunke maloom nahi kis ne us ko maara. Aur jo tu Allah ka naam le kar teer maaray phir agar tera shikaar, teer kha kar, aik din tak ghaib rahay, us ke baad tu us mein apne teer ke siwa aur kisi maar ka nishan na paye, to agar tera jee chahay to usay kha le aur agar tu us ko pani mein dooba hua paye to mat kha. (Muslim)."
"1240","[AI-translation] Abu Salaba Khushani (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur poocha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ham ahl-e-kitab, yani Yahud ya Nasaara, ke mulk mein rehtay hain, un ke bartanon mein khana khatay hain aur hamara mulk shikaar ka mulk hai, to main apni kamaan se, sikhaye hue kuttay aur us kuttay se shikaar karta hun jo sikhaya nahi gaya, to mujh se wo tareeqa bayan kijiye jo ke halaal ho. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke tu ne jo kaha ke ahl-e-kitab ke mulk mein hain aur un ke bartanon mein khatay hain to agar tum ko aur bartan mil sakein, to un ke bartanon mein mat khao aur agar aur bartan na milein to un ko dho lo aur phir un mein khao. Aur jo tu ne zikr kiya hai ke tum shikaar ki zameen mein rehtay ho, pas jis ko teer pahunche aur tu us par Allah ka naam le, to kha le. Aur jo sikhaya hua kutta pakray aur tu ne us par Allah ka naam liya ho to kha le. Aur jo baghair sikhaya hua kutta pakray, agar tu usay zabah kar lay to kha le. (Muslim). (Musalman mein maallazi hai.)"
"1241","[AI-translation] Adi bin Hatim (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se miraaz ke shikaar ke baaray mein poocha, to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jab laathi ki lohay wali taraf lagay to kha le aur jab lakri wali taraf lagay aur mar jaye, to wo waqeez hai, yani mauqooza hai jo pathar ya lakri se maara jaye aur wo Quran-e-Paak mein haraam hai, us ko mat kha. Aur main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kuttay ke baaray mein poocha to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jab tu Allah Taala ka naam le kar apna kutta chhoray, to kha le lekin agar kutta shikaar mein se kha le to mat kha kyunke us ne apne liye shikaar kiya. Main ne kaha ke agar main apne kuttay ke saath doosray kuttay ko paon aur ye maloom na ho ke kis kuttay ne pakra hai? To Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke mat kha, is liye ke tu ne sirf apne kuttay par Allah ka naam liya tha, doosray par nahi. (Muslim). (Miraaz se murad lohay ki nok wali laathi hai.)"
"1242","[AI-translation] Abu Salaba (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apna shikaar teen roz ke baad paye, to agar wo badboodaar na ho gaya ho to us ko kha le. (Muslim: 6/59)"
"1243","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat kartay hain ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kutta paalay basharteke wo shikaari na ho aur na janwaron ki hifazat ke liye ho, to us ke sawab mein se har roz do qeeraat ghat-tay jayein ge. Aik qeeraat Uhud pahaar ke barabar sawab ko kaha jata hai. (Muslim: 5/37)"
"1244","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs, bilazaroorat, kutta paalay magar ye ke wo rewar ya shikaar ya khait ke liye ho to, basoorat-e-deegar, us ke sawab mein se har roz aik qeeraat, sawab, kam ho ga. Zuhri, rawi, ne kaha ke Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) ke qaul ka zikr hua ke wo khait ke kuttay ko bhi mustasna kartay hain, to unhon ne kaha ke Allah Taala Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) par reham karay wo khait walay thay. Lekin rawi Zuhri ka ye asar munqata hai kyunke Muslim mein hi Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ki hadees mein khaiti ki hifazat ke liye kutta rakhnay ki ijazat maujood hai. (Muslim: 5/38). Baab: Kutton ke qatl ke baaray mein. (Ibn Umar ka ye qaul sahih nahi, Zuhri ne unhein paya nahi.)"
"1245","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kutton ke maarnay ka hukm kiya yahan tak ke aurat jungle se apna kutta le kar, Madina mein, aati to ham us ko bhi maar daaltay. Phir Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kutton ke qatl se mana farmaya aur kaha ke us siyah kuttay ko maar daalo jis ki aankh par do safed nuqtay hon kyunke wo shaitaan hota hai. (Muslim: 5/36). Baab: Kankari phenknay se mumaniat. (Baheem se murad khaalis siyah hai.)"
"1246","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Mughaffal (raziyallahu anhu) ne apne paas aik aadmi ko kankariyan phainktay hue dekha to usay mana kiya aur kaha ke beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kankariyan phainknay se mana kiya hai aur irshad farmaya hai ke beshak us se na shikaar hota hai, na dushman marta hai balke, jab kisi ke lagti hai to, daant toot jata hai ya aankh phoot jati hai. Rawi ne kaha ke phir Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne us ko kankariyan phainktay hue dekha to kaha ke main ne tujh se Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki hadees bayan ki ke Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se mana farmaya hai aur main dekhta hun ke tu phir kankariyan phainkay jata hai, ab main tujh se kabhi kalaam na karun ga. Khazf kankari ya guthli ya un ke manind koi aur cheez do ungliyon se phenkna hai. (Muslim: 6/72). Baab: Janwaron ka shikaar karnay se mumaniat."
"1247","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Zaid bin Anas bin Malik kehtay hain ke main apne dada Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) ke saath Hakam bin Ayyub ke ghar gaya aur wahan kuch logon ne aik murghi ko nishana banaya hua tha aur us par teerandazi kar rahay thay to Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne janwaron ko baandh kar maarnay se mana farmaya hai. (Muslim: 6/72)"
"1248","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair kehtay hain ke Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) Quraish ke chand jawanon par guzray, unhon ne aik parinda baandh kar usay hadaf banaya hua tha aur us ko teer maar rahay thay aur jis ka parinda tha us se ye muahida tha ke jo teer nishanay par na lagay us teer ko wo le le. Jab un logon ne Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ko dekha to alag ho gaye. Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) ne kaha ke ye kis ne kiya hai? Jis ne ye kiya hai us par Allah ki laanat ho. Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne kisi jaandaar cheez ko nishana bananay walay par laanat ki hai. (Muslim: 6/73). Baab: Achay zabah aur chhuri taiz karnay ka hukm."
"1249","[AI-translation] Shaddad bin Aus (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se do baatein yaad rakhi hain. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne har kaam mein bhalayi farz ki hai hatta ke jab tum qatl karo to achi tarah se qatl karo aur jab tum zabah karo to achi tarah se zabah karo aur chahiye ke tum mein se jo koi zabah karna chahay, wo chhuri ko taiz kar le aur apne janwar ko aaram de. Aur yehi mustahab hai ke janwar ke saamnay taiz na karay aur na aik janwar ko doosray janwar ke saamnay zabah karay aur na zabah karnay se pehle khainch kar le jaye. (Muslim: 6/72). Baab: Khoon bahanay wali cheez se zabah aur daant-nakhun se mumaniat. (Liyurih se murad aaram dena hai.)"
"1250","[AI-translation] Rafi bin Khadij (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Ham kal dushman se larnay walay hain aur hamaray paas chhuriyan nahi hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke jaldi kar ya hoshiyari kar, jo khoon baha de aur Allah ka naam liya jaye us ko kha le, siwa daant aur naakhun ke. Aur main tujh se kahun ga us ki wajah ye hai ke daant haddi hai aur naakhun Habshiyon ki chhuriyan hain. Rawi ne kaha ke hamein maal-e-ghaneemat mein oont aur bakriyan milein, phir un mein se aik oont bigar gaya, aik shakhs ne us ko teer se maara to wo thehar gaya. Tab Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya ke un oonton mein bhi baaz bigar jatay hain aur bhaag niktay hain jaisay jangli janwar bhaagtay hain. Phir jab koi janwar aisa ho jaye to us ke saath yehi karo. Yani door se teer se nishana lo aur us par Allah ka naam lo. (Muslim). (Ajil se murad jaldi hai; aawaabid se murad bhagnay walay hain.)"
